<programme channel="GB3200006AZ" start="20261116145209 +0000" stop="20261116155224 +0000">
    <title>Turkey</title>
    <sub-title>Beautiful Diversity - S1 E01</sub-title>
    <desc>The 1st episode of the ARTE series "Adventure Turkey" shows the Mediterranean region: blossoming orchards, olive groves and "still" untouched nature frame historical treasures. In this environment, tradition and modernity engage in a daily confrontation. Is it better to preserve old craft traditions? Can they be brought into the modern age? Sabine Howe meets women who are swimming free, men who are clinging on - but above all people who are trying anew every day to resolve this question for themselves.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQU352137A_1126234215_0_20250813T172030989Z_24_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5db7c6bc99-8fmg9.jpeg" />
