    <live />
    <episode-num system="original-air-date">20261116085500 +0000</episode-num>
    <desc>The ability of the Coral Triangle reef to adapt to climate change has alerted the scientific community, discovering that the main culprits are living beings of all sizes that live attached to the seabed, the so-called Benthonic.</desc>
