    <title>Wildbound by Forloh</title>
    <desc>In part 2 of the British episodes, Andy visits the majestic land of Scotland. Here he is introduced to Scottish deer stalking, a type of hunting that is full of history and etiquette. He hunts ‘monarch’ stags and goes into the Atlantic waters to find some of the freshest shellfish on the planet which he, and Mike Robinson cook and eat. Concluding the British episodes in a place as wild as Scotland really sets the tone for the series.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261116173001 +0000" stop="20261116180001 +0000">
    <title>Wildbound by Forloh</title>
    <desc>In this episode Andy and his son, Logan visit the beautiful country of New Zealand. From visiting Vineyards and sampling wine, to helicopter hunts for Himalayan Tahr, this episode is everything that is a hunters dream. As well as harvesting the wild game New Zealand has to offer Andy also learns about the importance of the conservation efforts that hunting has in this country from locals in which he spends time with.</desc>
  </programme>
  
