    <title>Kentucky Rifle</title>
    <desc>(1955) Suspenseful western with Chill Wills, Lance Fuller and Cathy Downs. When a gun-filled wagon breaks down in enemy territory, will its occupants surrender their cargo or fight for their lives?</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="64305451fc3be5947773c339-664e9d95e8824b0c34762787" start="20261116081708 +0000" stop="20261116100739 +0000">
    <title>Angel and the Badman</title>
    <desc>(1947) Western with the legendary John Wayne. A wounded gunslinger is taken in by a Quaker girl, who inspires him to give up his old ways - until his past catches up with him and puts her in danger.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="64305451fc3be5947773c339-664e9d95e8824b0c34762787" start="20261116100739 +0000" stop="20261116114808 +0000">
    <title>Abilene Town</title>
    <desc>(1946) Western with Randolph Scott, Edgar Buchanan and Lloyd Bridges. As tensions build between unruly cattlemen and determined homesteaders in post-Civil War Kansas, can one man keep the peace?</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="64305451fc3be5947773c339-664e9d95e8824b0c34762787" start="20261116114808 +0000" stop="20261116132636 +0000">
    <title>Gone Daughter Gone</title>
    <desc>(2020) Suspenseful thriller starring Andrea Bogart. When her daughter is abducted, Shannon decides to take matters into her own hands, putting her on a collision course with a deadly kidnapper...</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="64305451fc3be5947773c339-664e9d95e8824b0c34762787" start="20261116132636 +0000" stop="20261116150316 +0000">
    <title>Nanny Beware</title>
    <desc>(2023) Thriller starring Lesa Wilson. A nanny's dream job turns into a nightmare when she discovers the child in her care was kidnapped - and his 'parents' will do anything to keep the truth buried.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="64305451fc3be5947773c339-664e9d95e8824b0c34762787" start="20261116150316 +0000" stop="20261116163251 +0000">
    <title>An Organized Killer</title>
    <desc>(2021) Thriller with Allison McAtee. Needing help with her full but chaotic life, Grace hires a live-in assistant. And once Lilith is invited in, there's nothing she won't do... to get what she wants.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="64305451fc3be5947773c339-664e9d95e8824b0c34762787" start="20261116163251 +0000" stop="20261116180622 +0000">
    <title>Off The Rails</title>
    <desc>(2017) Thriller starring Hannah Barefoot. After surviving a train wreck, a married woman loses her memory. As the pieces of her old life start to come together, will the truth tear her apart?</desc>
  </programme>
  
